		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Verl 数据流：DataProto vs TransferQueue\n经典路线与新路线对比","x":80,"y":40,"width":620,"height":110,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"## 读图方式\n- 上排：经典 DataProto\n- 下排：TransferQueue\n- 关键差异：tensor 是否经过 controller","x":2130,"y":50,"width":430,"height":210,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a","type":"text","text":"## 经典路线｜DataProto\n- batch: TensorDict\n- non_tensor_batch\n- meta_info\n- 大 tensor 跟 batch 走","x":80,"y":250,"width":430,"height":320,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"p1","type":"text","text":"◇\n**worker return**\n返回字段","x":540,"y":350,"width":180,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b","type":"text","text":"## Controller 搬运 Batch\n- rollout output\n- logprob / value\n- reward tensor\n- union 合并字段","x":760,"y":250,"width":430,"height":320,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"p2","type":"text","text":"◇\n**DataProto.union**\n字段补齐","x":1220,"y":350,"width":190,"height":120,"color":"3"},
