		{"id":"note1","type":"text","text":"## 适用理解\n先用这条路线学习源码主流程：\n一个 batch 在每一步新增字段。","x":2130,"y":290,"width":430,"height":180,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"d","type":"text","text":"## 新路线｜TransferQueue\n- controller 传 metadata\n- tensor 存数据平面\n- key / partition_id\n- 字段 readiness 可追踪","x":80,"y":740,"width":430,"height":330,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"p3","type":"text","text":"◇\n**kv_put / kv_get**\n按 key 读写","x":540,"y":845,"width":190,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"e","type":"text","text":"## Data Plane\n- StorageManager\n- put_data / get_data\n- worker 直接读字段\n- 减少 controller 搬运","x":760,"y":740,"width":430,"height":330,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"p4","type":"text","text":"◇\n**ReplayBuffer**\n采样 ready keys","x":1220,"y":845,"width":200,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f","type":"text","text":"## Metadata Scheduling\n- KVBatchMeta\n- sample ready 状态\n- tags / keys\n- controller 只调度任务\n- tensor 留在数据平面","x":1450,"y":740,"width":450,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"note2","type":"text","text":"## 适用理解\n再看这条路线理解：\n为什么 main_ppo_sync.py 要把数据传输从 controller 身上移走。","x":2130,"y":790,"width":430,"height":210,"color":"6"}
